{"versions":[{"path":"versions/86d1e6cd-3b2a-4060-bdfe-76194efbb0f7/66f5bdaff8bf9c99e7daf6169b652ba57fbccb6261b6e5e11f92af272913e51a.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"86d1e6cd-3b2a-4060-bdfe-76194efbb0f7","revision":"sha256:66f5bdaff8bf9c99e7daf6169b652ba57fbccb6261b6e5e11f92af272913e51a","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某研究中，H0 是“新药与安慰剂疗效相同”。如果实际上 H0 成立，但研究者因为 P < 0.05 拒绝了 H0，这属于什么错误？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"第 I 类错误，也是假阳性。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"H0 真实成立却被拒绝，等于把“无效”误判成“有效”，概率由检验水准 α 控制。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7df8ec49-ed48-464f-9275-12f03cfe59d9/6cf25e7c8ece4ba257231c899b84ef1777ed78a160dd79d2b971e7ae209fb34e.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"7df8ec49-ed48-464f-9275-12f03cfe59d9","revision":"sha256:6cf25e7c8ece4ba257231c899b84ef1777ed78a160dd79d2b971e7ae209fb34e","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某降压药实际上有效，但一次小样本研究 P = 0.12，研究者没有拒绝 H0“药物无效”。这属于什么错误？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"第 II 类错误，也是假阴性。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"H0 实际上不成立，但检验没有发现差异，相当于漏掉真实效应，概率记为 β。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/d648e8bf-4090-4caf-9417-7f94028ad388/2d3f3549fe6f3f8e81924b1ef2ef3ed26c7ff8ebbfd9c51575597254d0816806.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"d648e8bf-4090-4caf-9417-7f94028ad388","revision":"sha256:2d3f3549fe6f3f8e81924b1ef2ef3ed26c7ff8ebbfd9c51575597254d0816806","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"若检验水准 α = 0.05，在 100 个真实 H0 都成立的独立检验中，平均会出现多少个假阳性？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"约 5 个。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"假阳性概率是 α = 0.05，100 × 0.05 = 5。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/58e8cccc-65db-4a22-8cd6-3dd06ae8b778/ac9459cd3e5771cd60a3022a2c12d72cdd6b30eb31d5f09b6bf6fe5e8bf50552.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"58e8cccc-65db-4a22-8cd6-3dd06ae8b778","revision":"sha256:ac9459cd3e5771cd60a3022a2c12d72cdd6b30eb31d5f09b6bf6fe5e8bf50552","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某研究的 β = 0.20，问检验效能 power 是多少？含义是什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"power = 1 - β = 0.80。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"检验效能表示当真实效应存在时，研究能正确拒绝 H0、发现差异的概率。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7d54ecb4-97c6-44d7-86cb-932601e355eb/3b111af6e851ccc126a77ae97ff97377874b0e337f14a2906a29afbc1ec6b46b.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"7d54ecb4-97c6-44d7-86cb-932601e355eb","revision":"sha256:3b111af6e851ccc126a77ae97ff97377874b0e337f14a2906a29afbc1ec6b46b","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"若其他条件不变，把 α 从 0.05 降到 0.01，假阳性和假阴性通常如何变化？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"假阳性减少，假阴性可能增加。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"α 更严格，拒绝 H0 更难，所以误报减少；但真实差异也更不容易被发现，β 往往升高。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/39bc70dd-fdb7-4654-a65b-d5f1bd8a84ff/f99fb95c6453bee6fb125f9ab2b091c538fb40af78eea6e2d29f7ec63ba4893f.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"39bc70dd-fdb7-4654-a65b-d5f1bd8a84ff","revision":"sha256:f99fb95c6453bee6fb125f9ab2b091c538fb40af78eea6e2d29f7ec63ba4893f","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"1000 人参加某病筛查，患病率 10%，灵敏度 90%，特异度 95%。求真阳性、假阴性、假阳性、真阴性。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"患病者 100 人：真阳性 90，假阴性 10；未患病者 900 人：真阴性 855，假阳性 45。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"灵敏度 = 真阳性/患病者，所以 100 × 90% = 90；特异度 = 真阴性/未患病者，所以 900 × 95% = 855。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/203c2342-7f28-48db-a5f7-b87f17874947/74d838329de78e69e4a17b50a8b06fa7b376ffc05bfb13f79c27edab7b2c952e.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"203c2342-7f28-48db-a5f7-b87f17874947","revision":"sha256:74d838329de78e69e4a17b50a8b06fa7b376ffc05bfb13f79c27edab7b2c952e","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"前题条件: 1000 人参加某病筛查，患病率 10%，灵敏度 90%，特异度 95%。求真阳性、假阴性、假阳性、真阴性。"},{"type":"text","content":"接上题，阳性预测值 PPV 和阴性预测值 NPV 分别是多少？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"PPV = 90/(90 + 45) = 66.7%；NPV = 855/(855 + 10) = 98.8%。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"PPV 问“阳性里真正患病的比例”；NPV 问“阴性里真正没病的比例”。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/887cf89e-b199-4e0a-9b16-653805f64e2f/7e99dc55bffa822d032eaa9059598d8d8a3fabddd33fb767f97ab31918c0c11c.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"887cf89e-b199-4e0a-9b16-653805f64e2f","revision":"sha256:7e99dc55bffa822d032eaa9059598d8d8a3fabddd33fb767f97ab31918c0c11c","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"若某病患病率只有 1%，10000 人筛查，灵敏度 90%，特异度 95%。为什么会出现“阳性结果里假阳性很多”？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"真阳性 90，假阳性 495，PPV = 90/(90 + 495) = 15.4%。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"低患病率时，未患病人数很大，即使特异度较高，也会积累出大量假阳性，因此阳性预测值受患病率明显影响。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/68584a59-337e-49c3-9086-d81558740ff6/edb9895bcb1b0d31a1797d560efc7cf1fe90e4e4a879ca3f642695c491fbdb0c.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"68584a59-337e-49c3-9086-d81558740ff6","revision":"sha256:edb9895bcb1b0d31a1797d560efc7cf1fe90e4e4a879ca3f642695c491fbdb0c","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"一项筛查项目最怕漏诊，应优先选择高灵敏度还是高特异度的检测？为什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"优先选择高灵敏度。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"灵敏度是在真正患病者中检出阳性的比例，灵敏度越高，假阴性越少，越不容易漏诊。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/06d976ec-920d-478e-843b-f71e7b7373c8/f358f68212801f1c0039e243fc402cec1bed3636f74a253134a54254917651b0.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"06d976ec-920d-478e-843b-f71e7b7373c8","revision":"sha256:f358f68212801f1c0039e243fc402cec1bed3636f74a253134a54254917651b0","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"进行 20 个相互独立的检验，且每个 H0 都真实成立，每个检验 α = 0.05。至少出现 1 个假阳性的概率约是多少？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"1 - 0.95^(20) ≈ 64.2%。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"这说明多次检验会使总错误率上升，所以多个均数比较时常用 ANOVA 控制总错误率，而不是反复做许多 t 检验。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/fb505480-17f6-4cca-b5fc-37ba2a2a91c8/a32cbd60b7c979425775dd467964c023fce4e507170f72611dd25ee33efa7963.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"fb505480-17f6-4cca-b5fc-37ba2a2a91c8","revision":"sha256:a32cbd60b7c979425775dd467964c023fce4e507170f72611dd25ee33efa7963","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某变量服从正态分布，总体标准差 σ 已知。样本量 n = 36，样本均数 x̄ = 104，检验 H0: μ = 100，已知 σ = 12。求 Z 值，并判断双侧 α = 0.05 时是否拒绝 H0。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"Z = (104 - 100)/(12/√36) = 2.00；拒绝 H0。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"双侧 α = 0.05 的临界值是 ±1.96，|2.00| > 1.96，所以 P < 0.05。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/05529dc2-4e06-44e1-b5c4-9e7b1266a242/b8941277992aa5666cc3c95c41526a7eed4ccb300ad224e994cf6d015724238a.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"05529dc2-4e06-44e1-b5c4-9e7b1266a242","revision":"sha256:b8941277992aa5666cc3c95c41526a7eed4ccb300ad224e994cf6d015724238a","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某班 16 名学生平均成绩 124 分，样本标准差 s = 8。检验是否不同于既往均值 μ0 = 120，双侧 α = 0.05。应使用什么检验？t 值是多少？若 df = 15 时临界值为 2.131，结论是什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"单样本 t 检验；t = (124 - 120)/(8/√16) = 2.00；不拒绝 H0。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"总体 σ 未知，用样本标准差 s 估计；|t| = 2.00 < 2.131。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/b7bf88da-e26d-48fd-9941-8abb0958ad97/2408c93855e26e0e13ead4681cda6a5f8f3cc30cef1bde500a87356e328d6722.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"b7bf88da-e26d-48fd-9941-8abb0958ad97","revision":"sha256:2408c93855e26e0e13ead4681cda6a5f8f3cc30cef1bde500a87356e328d6722","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"9 名患者治疗前后血压差值 d = 治疗后 - 治疗前。若差值均数 d̄ = -6，差值标准差 sd = 6，检验治疗后血压是否降低，单侧 α = 0.05，df = 8 临界值取 -1.860。应使用什么检验？结论是什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"配对 t 检验；t = -6/(6/√9) = -3.00；拒绝 H0，认为治疗后血压降低。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"前后配对资料先求差值，再把差值当作单样本 t 检验。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/1fe1d574-2914-4f6b-a1de-7eae5774adbc/6298648dd27e9ea209c5f95586d270a0fba098c42aa1340b18d0340dc18a28c8.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"1fe1d574-2914-4f6b-a1de-7eae5774adbc","revision":"sha256:6298648dd27e9ea209c5f95586d270a0fba098c42aa1340b18d0340dc18a28c8","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"两种教学法各 10 人，A 组均数 82、s = 6，B 组均数 76、s = 8。Levene 检验 P = 0.41。比较两组均数，应该优先用 pooled t-test 还是 Welch t-test？如果 Levene 检验 P = 0.01 呢？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"按题目教学规则, P=0.41时可在等方差模型下采用pooled t-test; P=0.01提示异方差时采用Welch. P>0.05不证明方差相等, Welch不要求先通过Levene筛选, 也可作为两独立均数比较的常用选择"}]}}},{"path":"versions/c96afdfb-9ab1-40a9-9548-3e65f13d3de5/bf4aecf3bcf43f4e2d0fa181a7fb5e49a68c8fee7757dc48924b1df44cd409e2.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"c96afdfb-9ab1-40a9-9548-3e65f13d3de5","revision":"sha256:bf4aecf3bcf43f4e2d0fa181a7fb5e49a68c8fee7757dc48924b1df44cd409e2","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"前题条件: 两种教学法各 10 人，A 组均数 82、s = 6，B 组均数 76、s = 8。Levene 检验 P = 0.41。比较两组均数，应该优先用 pooled t-test 还是 Welch t-test？如果 Levene 检验 P = 0.01 呢？"},{"type":"text","content":"接上题，用合并方差法粗略计算：sp² = 50，SE = √[50(1/10 + 1/10)] = √10。t 值是多少？若 df = 18，双侧 α = 0.05 临界值为 2.101，结论是什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"t = (82 - 76)/√10 = 1.90；不拒绝 H0。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"|1.90| < 2.101，差异未达到 0.05 水准的统计学显著。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/bbe75264-0356-4e20-a714-b0d344369af3/583ed683e9f14385e23fb4484e4482fca6c779690ec80d0c00c9b32afeff9217.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"bbe75264-0356-4e20-a714-b0d344369af3","revision":"sha256:583ed683e9f14385e23fb4484e4482fca6c779690ec80d0c00c9b32afeff9217","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"比较 4 种降压方案的平均降压幅度，为什么不建议两两反复做 t 检验？应该用什么方法？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"反复做 t 检验会使总假阳性率升高；应先用单因素方差分析 One-way ANOVA。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"ANOVA 的 H0 是 μ1 = μ2 = ... = μk；H1 是至少有两个组均数不等。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/b1a28e83-c46a-4185-88e7-611e8bf52b21/53ab7032ce51f7352adaa51438fcff0ddcaf6250183b31f9f6a900d11b6ff654.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"b1a28e83-c46a-4185-88e7-611e8bf52b21","revision":"sha256:53ab7032ce51f7352adaa51438fcff0ddcaf6250183b31f9f6a900d11b6ff654","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某单因素方差分析中，组间 SS = 60，组内 SS = 90，3 组共 30 人。求 F 值。若 F0.05(2,27) = 3.35，结论是什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"组间 df = 2，组内 df = 27；MSB = 60/2 = 30，MSE = 90/27 = 3.33，F = 30/3.33 = 9.00；拒绝 H0。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"F 值远大于临界值，说明至少有两组均数不等。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/87817d4a-86b3-4d00-886e-6342b10395a5/087d758304b8cf33af7ce06fd989c9398444d34091ab56415f76871b5bf68efd.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"87817d4a-86b3-4d00-886e-6342b10395a5","revision":"sha256:087d758304b8cf33af7ce06fd989c9398444d34091ab56415f76871b5bf68efd","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某地区调查洗手习惯与感染情况，数据如下。问应该用什么检验？若算得 χ² = 7.79，df = 1，临界值 3.841，结论是什么？"},{"type":"table","headers":["","感染","未感染","合计"],"rows":[["经常洗手","10","90","100"],["不常洗手","25","75","100"]],"align":["left","left","left","left"]}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"R-C 列联表的卡方独立性检验；拒绝 H0，认为洗手习惯与感染情况有关。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"分类变量与分类变量的关联用 χ² 检验；χ² = 7.79 > 3.841。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/37eb3ec2-3daa-408c-b1d3-033e15a47da5/ecd926ef9ff7be2498d4c6584d666bc2a3f0480a4699408b6c31b3c114503e85.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"37eb3ec2-3daa-408c-b1d3-033e15a47da5","revision":"sha256:ecd926ef9ff7be2498d4c6584d666bc2a3f0480a4699408b6c31b3c114503e85","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某分类变量理论上四类比例相等，实际观察频数为 30、20、25、25，总数 100。适合什么检验？χ² 值是多少？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"卡方拟合优度检验；各类期望频数 E = 25，χ² = (30-25)²/25 + (20-25)²/25 + 0 + 0 = 2。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"一种分类变量“比例对不对”用拟合优度检验；若 df = 3，α = 0.05 临界值 7.815，则不拒绝 H0。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/561070ad-9070-494d-960b-c0f94213e883/a502feeb46fb1d1206cf71a6b2bfa385372e5c4c62b9bf98bacf1f5f42fa8bf8.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"561070ad-9070-494d-960b-c0f94213e883","revision":"sha256:a502feeb46fb1d1206cf71a6b2bfa385372e5c4c62b9bf98bacf1f5f42fa8bf8","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"综合判断：某数据明显偏态、样本量很小且方差不齐，为什么可能不用 t 检验？若在 R 中检验“均值是否高于某值”，`t.test()` 的 `alternative` 应写什么？`prop.test()` 和 `chisq.test()` 默认有什么校正？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"小样本明显偏态可能使t统计量的参考分布不可靠, 可考虑与研究目标匹配的稳健/非参数方法; 仅方差不齐可以用Welch, 非参数方法也有独立性等适用条件. 检验均值是否较高用alternative=\"greater\". chisq.test默认correct=TRUE, 仅2×2列联表的渐近检验用Yates校正, 拟合优度, 更大列联表及simulate.p.value=TRUE不使用. prop.test默认correct=TRUE, 在适用的一组或两组比例检验中校正且幅度不超过相应比例差, 超过两组时不使用"}]}}},{"path":"versions/0de4766b-12ac-4932-89b8-a805297ec4ec/7cfc13e3bfda861d0dbcf987713caecdd86989aa6fd0e9751b41939e7a001eb4.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"0de4766b-12ac-4932-89b8-a805297ec4ec","revision":"sha256:7cfc13e3bfda861d0dbcf987713caecdd86989aa6fd0e9751b41939e7a001eb4","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"研究年龄与收缩压是否存在线性关系，二者都是连续变量。应先画什么图？可用什么指标描述线性关系强度和方向？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"先画散点图；可用 Pearson 相关系数 r。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"资料中提示“两个连续变量 → 散点图”；Pearson r 取值范围是 -1 到 1。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/7e5b1776-a228-43e2-a707-df0e0a95cb71/4c0a94af697a6d742383121733216cdaf9ae352c93975816d3d62f4f7dc820b0.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"7e5b1776-a228-43e2-a707-df0e0a95cb71","revision":"sha256:4c0a94af697a6d742383121733216cdaf9ae352c93975816d3d62f4f7dc820b0","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"若 Pearson r = -0.80，如何解释方向和强度？r² 是多少，表示什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"方向为负，线性关系较强；r² = 0.64。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"r² 表示因变量 Y 的变异中约 64% 可由自变量 X 的线性关系解释。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/f9d56b26-24a5-48e5-98ba-d3f3f1b1bac2/db31b0262bf042b62f1500b5655d1784fde640f1173bc8d59633cced60084781.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"f9d56b26-24a5-48e5-98ba-d3f3f1b1bac2","revision":"sha256:db31b0262bf042b62f1500b5655d1784fde640f1173bc8d59633cced60084781","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某简单线性回归中，x̄ = 10，ȳ = 30，Lxx = 20，Lxy = 50。求斜率 b、截距 a 和回归方程。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"b = Lxy/Lxx = 50/20 = 2.5；a = ȳ - bx̄ = 30 - 2.5×10 = 5；方程为 ŷ = 5 + 2.5x。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"回归方程形式是 ŷ = a + bx，b 是回归系数，a 是常数项。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/e7f04794-256d-4628-bd93-8e7bf894ca26/522ec23d08b3739ca475cc14bf1691192d23d3338f42f4284136f45a449be5d0.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"e7f04794-256d-4628-bd93-8e7bf894ca26","revision":"sha256:522ec23d08b3739ca475cc14bf1691192d23d3338f42f4284136f45a449be5d0","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"前题条件: 某简单线性回归中，x̄ = 10，ȳ = 30，Lxx = 20，Lxy = 50。求斜率 b、截距 a 和回归方程。"},{"type":"text","content":"接上题，当 x = 12 时，预测的 y 是多少？若实际 y = 38，残差是多少？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"ŷ = 5 + 2.5×12 = 35；残差 = 实际值 - 预测值 = 38 - 35 = 3。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"最小二乘法寻找的是残差平方和最小的直线。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/ea3fd061-9898-480e-97fb-ffea2d58d69f/acdff0b197668f02e40e20c45b42615fa2a60d665f2dde43a2e8a253e01f0ab8.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"ea3fd061-9898-480e-97fb-ffea2d58d69f","revision":"sha256:acdff0b197668f02e40e20c45b42615fa2a60d665f2dde43a2e8a253e01f0ab8","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某回归资料给出 Lxx = 40，Lyy = 100，Lxy = 50。求决定系数 r²。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"r² = Lxy²/(Lxx×Lyy) = 50²/(40×100) = 2500/4000 = 0.625。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"说明 Y 的变异中约 62.5% 可由 X 的线性回归解释。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/39cb910c-6e97-4205-b8b5-c5873671e410/1eeb862630af6a1a86537e5a6ff0e458bff5e3a39e505096153a67db0af22002.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"39cb910c-6e97-4205-b8b5-c5873671e410","revision":"sha256:1eeb862630af6a1a86537e5a6ff0e458bff5e3a39e505096153a67db0af22002","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"某简单线性回归 n = 12，回归平方和 SSR = 80，残差平方和 SSE = 40。求回归 F 值，并说明若 F0.05(1,10) = 4.96 时结论是什么。"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"MSR = 80/1 = 80，MSE = 40/(12-2) = 4，F = 80/4 = 20；拒绝 H0。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"回归 F 检验判断回归关系是否显著；F 越大，越有理由拒绝“回归系数为 0”的原假设。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/8ce497f7-4c01-40d0-a992-753ea42ec6c9/5e24bf3e3870048d5b5684c114f6da2ea80380ca389d97f6e16f8587b51e8a7e.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"8ce497f7-4c01-40d0-a992-753ea42ec6c9","revision":"sha256:5e24bf3e3870048d5b5684c114f6da2ea80380ca389d97f6e16f8587b51e8a7e","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"一组数据的 x 范围是 20 到 60。已建立回归方程后，能否用它预测 x = 90 时的 y？为什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"可以代入公式得到数值, 但x=90超出建模观察范围20到60, 属于外推, 不宜在没有额外证据的情况下认为预测可靠. 样本区间外的真实关系可能发生变化"}]}}},{"path":"versions/da8fbbee-00f7-4752-9b1f-7a9dc6f7e4c3/fe2c1dad162ee2bc1637fd62fc1f27e614de35142a0ce589260fc2129cedb34b.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"da8fbbee-00f7-4752-9b1f-7a9dc6f7e4c3","revision":"sha256:fe2c1dad162ee2bc1637fd62fc1f27e614de35142a0ce589260fc2129cedb34b","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"R 语言中写 `lm(BP ~ Age)`，谁是因变量？谁是自变量？若提取系数，第 1 个和第 2 个通常分别是什么？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"BP 是因变量，Age 是自变量；第 1 个系数是截距 Intercept，第 2 个系数是 Age 的回归系数。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"资料中提示公式格式是 Y ~ X，因变量在左，自变量在右。"}]}}},{"path":"versions/368f4c36-d15f-49e6-bd0f-4e7e14ca817d/52f45c18fbbcdb81ff3b310cd059fa0fc91e9f1fed8c2ac8628a4fb9f7603205.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"368f4c36-d15f-49e6-bd0f-4e7e14ca817d","revision":"sha256:52f45c18fbbcdb81ff3b310cd059fa0fc91e9f1fed8c2ac8628a4fb9f7603205","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"R 的 `summary(lm())` 输出中，Age 这一行的 `Pr(>|t|)` = 0.003，`Multiple R-squared` = 0.48。如何解释？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"Age系数的P=0.003, 在0.05水平拒绝该总体系数为0的H0. R²=0.48是整个模型解释的因变量样本内变异比例; 若模型只有Age, 可归于该单预测变量线性模型, 若还有其他变量则不能全部归于Age"}]}}},{"path":"versions/33fcbc68-d157-4708-b76b-a24e23c2b89a/1d843562d5ff7ab305d63e26ea849c0a4bbc29568e23f28f053544d4505466df.json","value":{"schema_version":2,"revision_scheme":"holly-question-v1","bank_id":"6b2314bf-8846-403a-bb6e-3d61c1a72fb1","question_id":"33fcbc68-d157-4708-b76b-a24e23c2b89a","revision":"sha256:1d843562d5ff7ab305d63e26ea849c0a4bbc29568e23f28f053544d4505466df","kind":"problems","content":{"question":[{"type":"text","content":"资料中 OR、RR、ARR、NNT、HR 各有适用场景。若研究生存时间并考虑时间因素，常见效应指标是什么？与哪类回归有关？"}],"answer":[{"type":"text","content":"HR，即 Hazard Ratio，风险比；常与生存分析或 Cox 回归有关。"}],"explanation":[{"type":"text","content":"HR 考虑时间因素，区别于病例对照研究常见的 OR 和队列/RCT 常见的 RR。"}]}}}]}